      "product": {
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>Shine together in these stunning Mommy and Me matching dresses, featuring an exquisite lace and sequin design. The soft tulle overlay adds a dreamy, ethereal touch, while the delicate crisscross back straps create a modern and elegant silhouette. Perfect for weddings, family photoshoots, or any special occasion, these dresses will make unforgettable memories in style. The lightweight, breathable fabric ensures comfort, while the shimmering sequins catch the light beautifully, making both mom and daughter feel like stars. The midi length provides a chic and graceful fit, ideal for any formal event.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Matching mother-daughter dresses with a beautiful lace and sequin design</li>\n<li>Elegant tulle overlay for a soft and ethereal look</li>\n<li>Crisscross back straps for a unique and stylish detail</li>\n<li>Perfect for special occasions, weddings, or photoshoots</li>\n<li>Lightweight and breathable fabric, ideal for comfortable wear</li>\n<li>Midi length offers a graceful and sophisticated style</li>\n<li>Available in sizes for both moms and daughters</li>\n</ul>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Length (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm / in)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>20 cm / 7.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3-4 Years</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>23 cm / 9.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5-6 Years</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>25 cm / 9.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 7-8 Years</td>\n<td>77 cm / 30.3 in</td>\n<td>28 cm / 11.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>30 cm / 11.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XS</td>\n<td>118 cm / 46.5 in</td>\n<td>32 cm / 12.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2 in</td>\n<td>34 cm / 13.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>125 cm / 49.2 in</td>\n<td>36 cm / 14.2 in</td>\n