      "product": {
        "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Timeless Elegance:</strong> Dive into grace with our mother-daughter matching monokinis, designed with a timeless chocolate brown shade that compliments all skin tones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Blend Fabric:</strong> Experience the perfect fusion of durability and softness with our high-quality blend of nylon and polyester fibers, ensuring a comfortable and lasting fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flattering Silhouette:</strong> The sleek halter neckline accentuates the shoulders, while the form-fitting design offers a flattering fit for every figure.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Adjustable Comfort:</strong> Customizable fit with adjustable polka dot tie sides, allowing for personalized comfort and style at the beach or poolside.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Style:</strong> Whether lounging by the water or engaging in water activities, our swimwear provides both functionality and fashion.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\n<p>Embark on your next sun-soaked adventure with our Elegant Chocolate Brown Monokini, tailored for the fashion-forward mother and daughter duo. Crafted from an exquisite blend of nylon and polyester fibers, this swimwear promises not just a touch of sophistication but also unparalleled comfort that adapts to your day.</p>\n<p>Designed to celebrate feminine charm, the swimwear features a sleek halter neckline that frames the face, while the body-contouring silhouette showcases your natural curves in a modest yet captivating manner. The playful polka dot ties at the sides aren’t just a nod to whimsical style; they also allow you to adjust the fit to your liking, ensuring that you and your little one can enjoy the waves without a worry.</p>\n<p>Whether it's a serene beach day or a playful pool session, our monokini is your go-to ensemble for creating memorable moments. Let the gentle waves be the backdrop to the story you and your daughter weave, with swimwear that's as enduring as the bonds you share.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Height (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Weight (kg / lbs)</th>\n<th>Bust (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Hips (cm / in)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<!-- Children's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2-3 years</td>\n<td>80-100 cm / 31.5-39.4 in</td>\n<td>10-15 kg / 22-33 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4-5 years</td>\n<td>102-110 cm / 40.2-43.3 in</td>\n<td>15.5-17.5 kg / 34-38.6 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5-6 years</td>\n<td>110-120 cm / 43.3-47.2 in</td>\n<td>17.5-20 kg / 38.6-44 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-8 years</td>\n<td>120-130 cm / 47.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>19-22.5 kg / 41.9-49.6 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8-10 years</td>\n<td>131-145 cm / 51.6-57.1 in</td>\n<td>22.5-31 kg / 49.6-68.3 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 10-12 years</td>\n<td>145-153 cm / 57.1-60.2 in</td>\n<td>31-37.5 kg / 68.3-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- Women's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>86.36-88.9 cm / 34-35 in</td>\n<td>66-68.58 cm / 26-27 in</td>\n<td>92.71-95.25 cm / 36.5-37.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>91.44-93.98 cm / 36-37 in</td>\n<td>71.12-73.66 cm / 28-29 in</td>\n<td>97.79-100.33 cm / 38.5-39.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>97.79-101.6 cm / 38.5-40 in</td>\n<td>77.47-81.28 cm / 30.5-32 in</td>\n<td>104.14-107.95 cm / 41-42.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>105.41-109.22 cm / 41.5-43 in</td>\n<td>85.09-88.9 cm / 33.5-35 in</td>\n<td>111.76-115.57 cm / 44-45.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01rro76K1tcKCQQBJJ2_!!4107585922-0-cib.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/